  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">롷허<ruby style=\"position: relative\">샬<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VVvhetcmrtc?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落雨聲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">롷허샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">哪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.3em\">나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">親像<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一條<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇ᄃᆤ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歌<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">과ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    loh-hor-siâ̰ nà chīn-chiṵ-jit-tiau-koâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">誰<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">샹ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知影<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">재ˉ얄`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">越頭<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">왇ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> 음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">敢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聽<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">턀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siáng jāi-yà̰ gùn oat-tháu m-kâ̰-thiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">異鄉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">이형ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一个<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">起<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">畏寒<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">위ˆ괄ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    i-hiông’e goà jit-e-láng khî-wî-koá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">寂寞<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">셕ˆ뻑ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雨聲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">허샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">捶<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뒤-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心肝<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ괄ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siôrk-bôrk’e hor-siâ̰ tui-gûn-sīm-koâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">孤單<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">像<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">츌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">斷翼<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">등싣ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">鳥隻<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄌᆤˆ쟣</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    láng kōr-toâ̰ chiṵ-tng-sît’e jiâu-jiah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">飛<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">붸ˉ-</rt></ruby>뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">걀ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">감<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">命<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    puē-boe-kiá̰ kâm-kông-si-gùn’e miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">故鄉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거`형ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">山<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">솰ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">永遠<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">옝완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">徛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">캬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">햐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kòr-hiông’e soâ̰ yeng-oân-lông-khia-ti-hiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ쟐ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">只<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">지ˆ-</rt></ruby>우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby>허<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">山<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">솰ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聽<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">턀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn’e sīm-jiá̰ jî-u-kông-hor-soâ̰ lai-thiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來到<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">래ᄀᅷ`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">故鄉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거`형ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">海岸<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">해ˆ활ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lai-kàu-kòr-hiông’e hâi-hoā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">景色<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">곙ˆ셱</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">猶原<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">유ˉ꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏總<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">렁ˆ정`</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">變化<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">볜`화</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kiêng-siek yū-goan-lông-jòng bo-pièn-hoa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">當初<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">덩ˉ처ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">離開<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">리퀴ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">샬`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tōng-chôr li-khûi si-wi-sià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">나ˉ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">問<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">믕ˉ</rt></ruby>’꾼 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心肝<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ괄ˆ</rt></ruby> 됴<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">疼<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">턀</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì na-mn̄g’gun gûn-sīm-koâ̰ tio-thia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">나ˉ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有孝<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">유ˆᄒᅷ`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">序大<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">싀돠ˉ</rt></ruby> 음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">免<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">好額<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">호ˆ꺟ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì na-bêh-yû-hàu-si-toā m-biên-tân-hô-giâh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">世間<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">세`간ˆ</rt></ruby> 우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">阿母<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">아ˉ뿌`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">惜<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">숗</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowr